<!-- 03 — WHAT STAYS -->
<section class="container measure section-block">
  <p class="label reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">03 — What stays, what adapts</p>
  <h2 class="display-md reveal reveal-delay-1" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Settle it up front instead of negotiating every deviation</h2>
  <p class="body-lg reveal reveal-delay-2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The central message and the visual identity stay the same in every country. Wording, choice of images, price argument and weighting of channels may adapt. This separation is recorded at the start. A national subsidiary can then act quickly without the brand looking slightly different in every country.</p>
</section>

